<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hisia in Kumpi Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah te Judah ngam ah kumpi in a maan hun le Jehoash tapa Jeroboam Israel kumpi in a maan hun a, Beeri tapa Hosea tungah Topa ii piak thupuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Hosea tungtawn a, Israel a paupui phitbel hunin Hosea tungah, “Pai in a, zi nei in; na zi in na vaang hong tang ngawl tu a, na tate ama bang lian ma hi tu hi. Tuasia bangma ka mite in kei hong nusia in, a thumaan ngawl te suak uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabangin Hosea in Diblaim tanu Gomer kici numei khat teenpui hi. A ta phit tapa sia a sua zawkciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Hosea tungah, “A min ‘Jezreel’ phuakin, banghang ziam cile Israel kumpipa sia a taanghpupi Jehu ii Jezreel ah mihing a thalupte hu in hai ngawlin daan ka pia tu hi. Jehu ii kumpi khangngui ka bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Jezreel Kuam ah Israel ngalkap thahatna ka susia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer in a ta niina — numei khat nei hi. Topa in Hosea munah, “A min ‘a ki it ngawl’ (Lo-Ruhamah) ci in phuak in, banghang ziam cile Israel mite tungah ka itna ka lak nawn buatu a, ahibuale mawna ka maisak nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Judah mite tungah ka itna ka lak tu hi, keima, amate ii Pathian, Topa in amate ka hun tu hi, ahihang ngal kisimna — namsau, thal le thaltang, ahibuale siphu le siphu ngalkapte ka zangh buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gomer in a tanuno noai a tensak zawkciang ama nau paai kik a, tapa dang khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in Hosea mun ah, “A min ‘Ka mi hi ngawl’ (Lo-Ammi ) ci in phuak in, banghang ziam cile Israel mite sia ka mi hi ngawl a, tuaciang kei sia amate ii Pathian ka hi bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite a kisim zo ngawl, a kitee zo ngawl tuipi sen za bang suak tu hi. Tu in Pathian in amate mun ah, “Note ka mite hi ngawl nu hi,” ci hi, ahihang, “Note sia a nungta Pathian ii tate hi nu hi!” a ci ni hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah mite le Israel mite kingawm kik tu hi. Amate mama in amate atu lampui khat teal tu a, khatvei ma a ngam a lei ah khangto in nuamsa kik tu uh hi. Hi hi, Jezreel ii ni sia ni thupi ni khat hi tu hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom na Israel mipuite sia, “Pathian ii mite” le “ Topa ii a it mite” ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tate awng, ama sia ka zi hi nawn ngawl a, keima a pasal ka hi nawn ngawl hang na nu tungah na thuum vun. Ama ii hong palngulna le pumpi kizuakna a kheal natu in thuum vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kheal buale a suani in a pumnguak a om bangin a nik a puan ka sutkeaksak tu hi. Leiko le lei kolhna mun taw kibangin ama ka vawt tu a, dangko in thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tate tungah hesuakna ka nei buatu hi; amate a maizum maw pumpi kizuak nu ii tate ahi hi. Ama mama in, “Ka lawmpate kungah ka pai tu a — amate in an le tui, samul puan le pat puan, olive thau le sapittui hong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama sia lingdai taw ka uum tu a, a lampi khaktan tu in luphung ka ciang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a lawmpate del tu hi, ahihang pha zo ngawl tu hi. Ama in amate zong ahihang mu ngawl tu hi. Tuasia ciang ama in, “Ka pasal phit sia kungah heak kik ka tong — tua ka kiteen hun lai sia tu a sang nuam zaw ka na ve” ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ii Baal biakna ah a zak ngunn le khamh theampo le olive thau, sapittui le antang a pia sia keima ka hi hunlam ama in kitelsak ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom anlaak hun ciang ka piakthongsa antang le sapittui te tuaciang a silh tu ka piak samul le patpuan te ka la kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lawmpate mai ah a nguaktangin om tu in a puan a nikte ka suukeaksak tu a, kuama in ka khut sung pan ama hun zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ii poai khaamnate theampo — kum sim le tha sim a poaite le Sabbath poaite — a biakna taw kisai kikhopna theampo ka bosak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pumpi a kipiak ciang, a lawmpate ii saapna in hong piak hi a ci sapitkungte le theikungte ka siasak tu hi. Ama ii sapithuante le a thingnga huante duipui ka suaksak tu a; ngamsate in susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Baal tungah ngimnamtui khat a hal ciang le a suangmanpha kizepnate taw kizeamin a lawmpate a del hun lai a kei hong makngil hu in ama daan ka pia tu hi. Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom sennealngam sungah ama ka paipui kik tu a; tua munah ki itna kam taw ama ka zol kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sapithuante ama tungah ka piakik tu a, Ngimna Kuam sia lam etna kongpi ka suaksak tu hi. A khanmoi lai Egypt ngam pan hong pusua hun bangma in tua munah ka thu hong ngai kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kei sia khatvei ka pasal hong ci kik tu a — ama ii Baal hong ci nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baal min ka losak kik ngei nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hun ciang ka mite a liamsua ngawl natu in ngamsate le vacimte taw thuciamna ka vawt tu hi. Ngalhiam theampo ahi, namsaute le thalte zongh ngamsung panin ka sot siat tu a, ka mite sia a kilem a ngammuangin ka teangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel awng, ka zi kong suaksak tu a; a thumaan le a citak kong hi tu hi; Ki itna kip le hesuakna kong lak tu a, a tawntungin keima aa kong suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kamciamte ka len tu a. keima aa kong hisak tu hi. tuaciang keima Topa in nong saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua hun ciang Israel ka mite ii thungetnate ka zo tu hi. Lei tungah ngua ka zusak tu a, tuaciang leitang in lo an, sapit le olive nga te piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite tua ngam ah ka khosak tu a, ka nuamsasak tu hi. “A ki it ngawl” a kicite tungah itna ka lak tu a, tuaciang “Ka mi hi ngawl” a kicite tungah, “Note ka mi nu hi,” ka ci tu hi, tuaciang amate in, “Nangma kote Pathian na hi hi,” ci in hong zo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kei tungah, “Pai kik ta'n a, a lawmpa taw nang hong palngul numei tungah na itna lak ta'n. A milimte sapitnga ko pia thanuam in pathian dangte zuan kale Israel mite ka it veve bangin tua nu it nanak tu ni hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua nu ka lei natu in ngunn dangka sawm le nga le mangtaang kilogramme 150 ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama munah khuangeipi pumpi zuak ngawl le hong palngul ngawlin kei hong ngakin na om kul tu hi, ka ci hi; tuaciang hi hunsung tengin kei zongh in ama ka ngak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi bang lian ma in, Israel mite in kumpi ahibuale lampui nei ngawl, sangaw biakpiakna ahibuale suangkhuam thiangtho nei ngawl, aisaan natu milim ahibuale limte zangh ngawlin hun sau mama sung a nuntak uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Israel mite in amate ii Pathian Topa kung le kumpi David suan khat ii kung a zot kik tu hun khat hong theng tu hi. Tuasia ciang amate in Topa kiita tu a, ama ii letsong phate saang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi ngam sungah a teang mite tungah Topa in mawsakna khat nei hi. Israel awng, ama pauna ngai vun: “Hi ngam sungah thumaanna hikale ki itna hikale om ngawl a, mite in keima Pathian in hong saang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in kamciamte pia a, paltan hi; amate leilot in, mihing that a, nguta in, kipalngul uh hi. Khialna liante khang a kithalupna khat zawkciang khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang a ngam kaanghko tu a, ngam sungah nuntakna nei theampo thi tu hi. Nganhingte, vacimte theampo le ngasate ngawngawn thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Kuama in mite mawsak ahibuale, teih heak hen — ka lungkim ngawlna sia noma thiampite tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sun taw zan taw note khial tan nu hi, tuaciang kamsaangte no sangin phazaw tuan ngawl hi. Na nu, Israel susia tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite in kei hong saang ngawl ahikom a lal hi zo hi. No thiampite in kei hong saang ngawlin kong hilnate hong nial nu hi, tua ahikom no kong nial a, na tapate ka thiampi tu in ka saang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“No thiampite na tam vaial uh ciang, ka tungah nong khial vaial uh hi, tua ahikom na minphatna uh sia minsiatna ka suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite mawna khialna te tung pan hau law na hi uh kom amate khial vaial le na oai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua mite daan thuak bangma in na thuak tu uh hi! Siatna na vawt hu in kong liausak tu a, daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in sangaw biakpiakna pan, na satel te ne tu na hi uh hang na ngil uh kial veve tu hi. Ta nei theina pathiante bia tu na hi uh hang ta na nei tuan buatu uh hi, banghang ziam cile note in pathian dangte nungzui tu in kei nong nung ngat zo uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Sapittui in, a lui ahizong, a thak ahizong, ka mite ii khua phawna laksak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in thingbek khat tung pan thupualaakna dongh hi! Ciangkang khat in amate heak nopte son hi! Amate in kei hong nusia zo uh hi. Pumpi zuak a suak numei khat bangin amate le amate ii pathian dangte tungah ki aap zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in mualpi dawn mun thiangthote ah sangaw biakpiaknate pia in, mualnote tung thingkung a saang, a boaite nuai ah ngimnamtui hal uh hi, banghang ziam cile tua thinglim te nuam mama hi! “Tua hu in, na tanute sia pumpi zuakte suak a, na mote in palngul mawna vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahitazong, hi sia hu in amate daan pia ngawl tu khi hi, banghang ziam cile noma mama zongh biakinn a pumpi zuak numeite omkhop pui in, amate taw lawki sangaw biakpiaknate na pia khawm uh hi. Paunak khat sungah, ‘Ngaisutna nei ngawl mihingte kilalsak tu hi,’ a ci bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“No Israel mite in kei tungah hong thumaan ngawl na hi uh hang Judah te in tuabang in mawna nei heak tahen. Gilgal ah ahibuale Bethaven ah biakpiakna vawt heak vun, tua ahibuale tua munah a nungta Topa min taw kamciam vawt heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite sia laate bangin thinpui hi. Bangbangin amate lopa hingna sungah tuuno bangin taasak thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mite sia milimte ii ngau tawk hi. Amate lampi tek tawn lel tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sapittui tam mama a neak zawkciang amate pumpi zuakna taw nuamsa in, minphatna saang in minsiatna dei zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate vuipi seam bangin kiseamkeak tu a, a lawki sangaw biakpiaknate hangin amate maizum nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“No thiampite awng, hi thu ngai vun! Israel mite awng, nadon vun! Kumpi bangkua sung a omte awng, ngai vun! No sia, thutang khen tu in hong kituat ahiciang — no tungah thukhenna hong theng tu hi! Note in Mizpah ah thaang khat, Tabor mual tungah ngen kikhak khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Acacia Khuapi ah dum thuk khat na suak uh a, na vekpi in daan kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel bangbang hi ziam, he khi hi — ama kei kung pan buu thei ngawl tu hi. Ama thumaan ngawl a, a mite sia kei hong bia tu in kilawm ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite ngamtat siatna in amate ii Pathian kung a heakkik tu khak hi. Milim biakna in amate nasia takin len ahiciang, Topa saang ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mite kiphatsak na in amate langpanin ausan hi. A mawnate in amate lutusak a, Judah mite zongh amate taw puk khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a tuute le a khuite Topa tungah sangaw biakpiakna tu in pia ahihang amate atu phattuamna om ngawl hi. Amate in Topa mu thei ngawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in amate nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate Topa tungah thumaan ngawl a; a tate Topa neisa hi ngawl hi. Tua hi a, tu in amate le a ngam a lei kisusia pal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeah ah ngal dona lemle tum vun! Ramah ah patau daak saat vun! Bethaven ah minsial vun. Benjamin mite awng ngal simin kuan vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Daan thuak tu ni hong theng tu a, Israel kisusia tu hi. Israel mite awng, hisia piang tatak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Kei ka thin uuk hi, banghang ziam cile Judah lampuite in Israel simin, a ngam sut hi. Tua ahikom amate tungah namthuam bangin daan ka buak suk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel in nenniam thuak a; a neisa tatak ahi leitang taan hi, banghang ziam cile huna piak tu a nei ngawlte munah huna ngen hamtang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel tungah siatna le Judah mite tungah lalna ka tungsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Israel in a ciinatna bangza ziam ci sia a kimu ciang le Judah in ama ii liammate a kimu ciang, Israel in Assyria kumpilianpa kungah hu ngenin pai hi; ahihang ama in a natna le a liammate damsak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in tawpi khat bangin Israel le Judah mite ka sim tu hi. Keima mama in amate ka balneen tu a ka nusia tu hi. Amate ka kaikeak ciang kuama in hun zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Keima in a mawna a khialna hu in a thuak tu za in a thuak dong le kei hong zon kik mateng ka mite ka nusia tu hi. Ngimna a thuak ciang amate in kei hong zon tu hanciam tha tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mite in, “ Topa kungah heak kik tawng! Ama in ei hong liamsak zo a, ahihang ama in hong damsak kik nanak tu hi; ama in hong liamsua zo a, ahihang ama in ih liammate hong tuamsak tu hi ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni nii, ni thum sungin eite tha thak hong pia kik tu a, ama ompui na ah ih nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ih heak natu hanciam tawng. Khuapi ngua hong zu a, leitung tui a buak bang ahizong, a hun maan a, khua a vak bang ahizong ei kungah ama hong pai tatak tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in, “Israel le Judah awng, bang hong law tu khi ziam? Kei nong itna uh sia zingsang mokkaai bangin manlang tak bo a; ni vaisaang ciang a bo pai daaituite bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hu in no kungah thukhenna le lalsakna thu puakin ka kamsaangte kong paisak zo hi. Note tung pan ka dei thu sia thiang a kitel sinsen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tatsat ngawl nong itna ka dei a, na sangaw biakpiaknate hi ngawl hi. Ka mite ii meihal biakpiaknate hong piak sangin kei hong heak tu dei zaw khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ahihang amate in Adam ngam sungah a tum po ciang amate taw thuciamna ka vawt sia paltan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead sia mi siate le mithatte taw a kidim khuapi khat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thiampite sia mihing khat suam nuamin a pang phalak honkhat taw kibang hi. A thiangtho mun Shechem paina lampi tung ngawngawn ah amate in mihing that uh hi. Tuaciang amate in hi siatna theampo vawt kaltang uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel ngam sungah a cizat huai na khat ka mu zo hi: ka mite sia amate le amate milim biakna taw kininsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuaciang no Judah mite na hi uh le, na sep na vawtte tungtaang ah daan piak tu hun khat zongh ka ciangtan zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel ka mite a ciidam in a nopsak, a khanto kik tu ka vawtsak nop simin, amate seksolna le a ngamtatsiatna te bebek ka mu thei bek hi. Amate khat le khat kitheam a; inn phuulin vanh ngu hi, tuaciang lampi ah ngual neisa suttol uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi a ngamtat siatna theampo ciamtee tu ka hi hunlam amate in ngaisun ngeingawl uh hi; ahihang a mawnate in amate kiim uum a, tuate mu ngawlin ka om thei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Mihingte in thusia vawt a sawmnate taw kumpipa le a uliante theam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a vekpi thutuum ngawlin citakna nei ngawl uh hi. Anluum em pa in anvui thau in, a em thei hun mateng anluum emna mei sawk ngawlin a mei a khep bangin a ki etsatna iip phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa ii poai vawt ni in amate in kumpipa le a uliante sapittui khamsakin mawmawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi hi, amate ii a sawmna uh taw amate moh emna meisa bang hi. Amate thin uukna sia zankhuateakin dai a, zingsang in meileng bangin puaktham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a thin uuk saan laitakin a ukte thatlum uh hi. A kumpipate khat zawkciang khat kisuamlum ahihang kei tungah huu na dei in thu hong ngen om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite anluum minphang khat taw kibang hi. Amate in a kiimkot ngamte suang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hi ngamdangte a suanna in amate thahatna kisut ahi hunlam phawk ngawl uh hi. Amate ii ni hunte kiciangtan hi, ahihang amate in tua ngawngawn zongh he ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel mite kiphatsak na in amate langpanin ausan uh hi. Hi bang a piang tu theampo piang zo kazu in amate sia keima, Topa a Pathian kungah hong zuan kik ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Inn vakhu mawmaw khat bangin Israel te leang kawkoai hi; amate in Egypt te tungah huna ngen masa uh hi, tua zawkciang Assyria ah tai uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang keima in amate paina po ah ngeen khakin vacimte mat bangin ka man tu hi. A ngamtat siatnate hu in amate daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Amate a lal hi zo hi! Amate in kei hong taisan a, hong langpan hi. Amate kisusia tu hi. Amate suatak nuam ka hihang amate ii kei hong biakna maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in thin tak taw thu ngen ngawl uh hi, tua sangin amate lei ah kisepin lawkite ngamtat bangin kapin mau uh hi. Sapittui le antang atu thu a nget ciang doaibiate bangin amate le amate kikuikeak uh hi. Bangza in hong langpan ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in amate khangtosakin, a thahatsak pa hi napi, amate in kei langpan hong sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate kei kung pan kiheak tawntungin vang nei ngawl pathian khat tuu uh hi. Amate sia thalkawng telh khat bangin muanhuai ngawl hi. A lampuite in kisak theina kampau ahikom amate thi ngamin thi tu a, tuaciang Egypt te nui tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Patau daak tum vun! Ngalte muvanlai bangin ka ngam sungah hong suktun hi! Ka mite in amate taw ka vawt thuciamna paltan a, ka hilna langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in kei hong he a, na mite hi ung ci a, a Pathian hi ci in hong sap hang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate in a phate nial hi. Hi thu hu in a ngalte in amate delkot tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka mite in kumpite teal hi, ahihang amate uuk bang bek in teal uh hi. Amate in lampuite teal ahihang kei thukim puina om ngawl hi. Amate in a ngunn le a khamh la in milim in vawt a — amate lal natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria khuapi a teang mite ii a biak khamh khuital sia ka ensan hi. Amate tungah ka thinso hi. A milim biakna a kheal natu in bang tanvei ngei lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi khut thiam khat in milim vawt a, tua in pathian khat hi vet ngawl hi! Samaria ah a kibia khamh khuital sia a bebekin kisutham tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in vuipi thaicii a poai ciang, vuipi suangval at tu hi! A min ngawl lo ante in bangma hun anluum piangsak thei ngeingawl hi. A piangsak hial zong, ngamdangmite in netum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel ngam sia ngamdang khat pawpo taw kibang zo a, leibeal tamhtham sa khat bangin kimanna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngam laate bangin a thinpui Israel mite in amate sansak tek zuan uh hi. Amate in Assyria tungah hu ngen tu in pai a, amate sungsia tu in a dang ngamte sum taw tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihang tu in amate ka khawmtua tu a, daan ka pia tu hi. Assyria kumpilianpa in amate a nencip ciang, hai ngawlin bot sa in kilep vadel tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel mite in mawphel natu biaknatau tam vaial a vawt ciang mawna khialna a vawt natu mun tam a nei vaial suak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipite atu in a kisim zo ngawl thuhilnate ka at hi, ahihang amate in tuate sia thu lamdangpi le ngamdangte aa hi ci in nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in sangaw biakpiaknate kei tungah vawt in tua sangaw biakpiakna sa te ne uh hi. Ahihang keima, Topa in amate tungah ka lungkim ngawl hi, tu in amate mawna ka phawk kik tu a, tua hu in daan ka pia tu hi; Egypt ngam ah amate ka puak kik tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Israel mite in kumpi innte sa zo ahihang amate in amate a Vawtpa mama mangil uh hi. Judah mite in kulh taw a ki uum khuapite saat uh hi. Ahihang a kumpi innte le a khuapite a kaanghthamsak tu meikuang ka puak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite awng, na poaipite lawkite bangin khaam heak vun. Note in na Pathian nungngat in, ama tungah thumaan nawn ngawl zo nu hi. Ngamsung mun theampo ah pumpi kizuakte bangin Baal pathian tungah noma le noma kizuak in, ama ii hong kithapna hi na ci uh lo ante iip la nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang hai ngawlin antang le olive thau a kicing nei nawn ngawlin, sapittui om ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite sia Topa ii leitang tungah taang ngawl tu ahihang, Egypt ah heak kikin Assyria ah a kikhaam ante ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in tua ngamdangte ah Topa tungah sapittui biakpiakna ahibuale sangaw biakpiakna vawt thei ngawl tu uh hi. Amate ii an in a ne pawpo ninsak tu a, mithi ngalna ah anneak bang hi tu hi. Amate ii kiallap bekma hi tu a; Topa Biakinn ah biakpiakna in khat zongh kipaipui ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa patoai natu poaipi khaam hunte a tun ciang, amate in bang law peuma tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasiatna hong pai in, mihingte a kithethaang ciang Egypt te in amate khawmtua tu a — Memphis ah vui tu in khawmtua tu hi! A ngunn sumngumte le khatvei lai a, a innmunte sia lopa le lingkungte in khunel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Daan piak hun hong theng zo a, mite in amate ii nga tu a kilawm daan a nga tek tu hun hong theng hi. Tuasia hong pian ciang Israel in he tu hi! Nangma in, “Hi kamsaang pa sia a mawmaw khat hi. Hi Pathian ii thumop pa sia a thin amh hi,” ci nu hi. Na mawna a let lawlawm manin note in kei nong ensan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in Israel a mite kidop natu thupia tu in kamsaang khatin kei hong sawl hi. Tua hikasap ka paina po ah vacim khat bangin thaangsia tu nong sawm uh hi. Pathian Biakinnpi tung ngawngawn ah mihingte sia kamsaangpa ii ngalte suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeah ah a ngamtat bangin a sep a vawtna ah amate siat tawpin sia hi. Pathian in a mawna ciamtee tu a, tua hu in amate daan pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel ka mu phitin sennealngam sungah a po sapitngate mu bang ahi hi. Na taanghpupite ka mu phit hunin thei min hun a, a min masate mu bang ahi hi. Ahihang Peor mual ah hong pai uh ciang amate in Baal a biak hong kipan a, hai ngawlin a khiaklaak pathiante bangma in mu thada huai suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel letna sia vacim khat bangin leang tu hi, amate sung panin ta piang ngawl tu a, naupaai le naungil om numei om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang patang a kep a om hial zong tuate ka laaksak tu a, a nungta in khat zongh ka nusiat buatu hi. Hi mite ka taisat ciang amate tungah a lauhuai nate piang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, a tate savai bangin kivai in, a kithalup ka mu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua mite bang law tu ci in nang tungah hong dongh tu khi ziam? A numeite ciingsak in! A nausente a op thei ngawl tu in vawt in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in, “Amate ngamtat siatnate theampo Gilgal pan kipan hi. Tua mun in amate ka etsat kipatna mun ahi hi. Amate ngamtat siatna hu in ka ngam panin amate ka notkeak tu hi. Amate ka it nawn buatu hi; a lampuite theampo in kei hong langpan zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite sia a zungte ko in, a nga nga ngawl thingkung khat taw kibang hi. Amate in ta nei ngawl tu a, a nei hial zong a it mama a tate ka thatlum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A na ka sepsak Pathian in a mite nial tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in a thu nangai ngawl uh hi. Amate sia minam tuatuamte kawmah a vakvaite suak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite sia a ngathiam sapitkung khat taw kibang hi. A ci thei vaial ciang biaknatau tam seseam vawt uh hi. A leitang panin a piang a tam seseam ciang a biak uh suangkhuam thiangthote zepna hoisak vaial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungtang uh theam nopna taw a kidim mite sia tu in a mawnate hu in a thuak kul tu hi. Pathian in a biaknataute sutham tu a, a khuam thiangthote susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi mite in hai ngawlin, “Eite kumpi ih nei ngawlna in Topa ih kiitak ngawl hang ahi hi. Ahihang kumpi khat in ei atu in bang hong vawtsak thei tuan tu ziam?” ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in a luithawthong kamte pau in, a maan ngawl kamciamte pia a, a kizangh thei ngawl kilem natu thukimnate vawt uh hi. Thutang sia thutang ngawl suak zo a, lothawna sa sungah a nguu nei lopate bangin po hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria khuapi ah a teang mite lau in, Bethel ah khamh khuital a bo hu in khuangai tu uh hi. Amate le milim biakna ah a seam thiampite sia tuasia thangai in kap tu uh hi. A khamhcii kizepna hoi teng a kihawkeaksak ciang amate mau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua milim sia a kumpilianpa maivil natu in Assyria ah kipua tu hi. Tua ngaisut piakna bang a zui hu in Israel minpaan tu a, kimaizumsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tui tungah a laam thingbek khat bangin a kumpipa kipaipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite ii milim biakna mun ahi Aven mualdawn biakbukte kisusia tu hi. Lingkungte le lophungte in a biaknataute khunel tu hi. Mite in mualpite tungah, “Hong seal tavun!”, tuaciang mualnote tungah, “Hong siin tavun!” ci in sam tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in “Gibeah ah mawna a vawt hun pan kipan Israel mite kei tungah mawna a vawt uh kheal ngawl hi. Tua ahikom Gibeah ah ngal in amate lap tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi mimawte ka sim tu a, daan ka pia tu hi. Minam tuatuamte kikaizawnin amate langpan tu a, amate mawna a tam hu in daan kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel sia khatvei lai in a pha takin taangcil tu a kihil sa, taangcil nuamin a kinging khuila khat taw kibang hi. A ngawng hoi sia tungah hakkol khat bulsak in nasep hamsa zaw seamsak tu in ka khensat hi. Judah in lo thawna thingha sia ka kaisak a, Israel in lei kalthapna thik-ha ka kaisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in, “Noma atu in leithak tho vun a, thutang suana ciingin, kei nong biakna pan a piang tu thuphate at vun. Na Topa ahi kei sangah nong kiheak tu hun zo a, tuaciang kong pai tu a, no tungah thupha kong buak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang siatna thaicii na ciing uh a, tuate anlaak in na nei uh hi. Na leilotnate pan a piang a ngate na ne zo uh hi. “Na siphu ngalleangte le ngalkap tam na neina na suan hu in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na mite tungah ngal hong theng tu a, na kulh theampo kisusia tu hi. Tua ni in Kumpi Shalman ii Betharbel khuapi ngal sungah a lalcipsak le, nute le a tate a kisuklup siat ni bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua in no, Bethel mite ii a kiitakhuai siatna na vawt uh hu in hong tung tu thu ahi hi. Ngal kido a kipat po ciang Israel kumpipa thi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel sia patangno khat ahi lai in ama ka it a, ka tapa bangin Egypt ngam pan ka samkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang ama ka sap a tam vaial ciang hong nungngat san vaial hi. Ka mite in Baal tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia hi; amate in milimte atu in ngimnamtui hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahitazong, Israel lampai tu a hil sia keima ka hi hi. Ka mite ka khut sungah ka toai hi, ahihang keima ii ka khoi hunlam amate in tel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itna le deisakna taw keima sangah amate ka kai hi. Ka domto a ka biangkho taw ka kiphatosak hi; ka kunsuk a, amate an ka vaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kei kungah hong heak kik nuam ngawl ahiciang, Egypt ma ah a heak kik uh kul tu a; tuaciang Assyria te in amate uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngal in a khuapite phialmang tu a, a kongpite sutham siat tu hi. A uuk thu in phabel a sak bang po in ngamta ahikom tuasia in ka mite susia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in kei kung pan puapial tu bebek ma sawm vatan uh hi. Amate tungah hakkol kisuanh ahi hu in kap tu ahihang kuama in a vanh dawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Israel awng, bangbangin hong thasua thei tu khi ziam? Bangbangin hong nusia thei tu khi ziam? Admah ka suksiat bangin hong susia ngei tu khi ziam? tua ahibuale Zeboiim tungah ka vawt ngei bangin nang hong vawt tu khi ziam? Ka lungtang in tuabang hong vawtsak ngawl tu hi! Nang kong itna sia nasia lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thin uuk hu in nang daan kong pia buatu hi; Israel ka susia kik buatu hi. Banghang ziam cile kei mihing hi ngawlin Pathian khi hi. Keima a Thiangtho Pa in note taw kong omkhawm hi. Thin uuksa in nang kung kong pai buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A ngalte tawpi bangin ka hawksan ciang ka mite in kei hong zui tu hi. Amate in nitumna sang pan kei kung manlang takin hong zuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate Egypt pan vacim bangin, Assyria pan vakhute bangin manlang takin hong pai tu uh hi. Amate a inn tek ah ka ciasak kik tu hi. Keima Topa in ka ci zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite in kei leilot thu le theamna taw hong kiim uum a, Judah mite in kei a thumaan le a thiangtho Pathian hong langpan lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zingsang pan nitak dong Israel mite ngamtatnate theampo kimanna om ngawl a, siatna vive hi. Ciampealna le ngoltol ngamtatna sia amate sungah khangto vaial hi. Amate in Assyria taw ngal kilemna thukimnate vawtin Egypt taw sum vawt khawm uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah mite tungah Topa in mawsakna khat nei hi; Israel zongh a mite ngamtatna bangin daan pia tu hi. Amate ngamtatna sate bangin ama in thuk kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A taanghpupi Jacob sia apeang a suapuipa Esau taw a nu ngil sungah a omkhop lai ma in kilaai hi; Jacob hong khan ciang ama in Pathian langpan hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in vantunglalang khat buanin zo hi. Ama kapin thupha ngen hi. Tuaciang Bethel ah ih taanghpupi Jacob kungah Pathian pai in paupui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hisia in Vaanglianbelpa Topa Pathian ahi hi — Topa sia ama ih biak natu min ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Jacob suan le paalte awng, na Pathian muang vun a, ama kungah heak kik vun. Pathian tungah citakin thutang vun, tuaciang na Pathian ii note atu hong sep tu sia thinsau takin ngak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite sia Canaan mite bangza ma in thumaan ngawl uh hi; amate in vanh leite toaisuang maan ngawl taw theam thanuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in ‘Ko hau khu hi, nei le lamh khol zo khu hi. Kuama in thimthelna taw hau hi ci in, ko hong mawsak thei ngawl hi,’ ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang, Egypt ngam pan hong pusua pui keima, Topa na Pathian in, senneal ngamsung noma kungah kong pai lai bangma in tuipuan buk sungah kong teangsak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kamsaangte ka paupui a, mukholna tam mama ka pia hi, tuaciang kamsaangte tungtawnin ka mite kidop natu thu ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hi napi Gilead ah milimte kibia a, a biate thi tu hi. Gilgal ah khuitalte sangaw biakpiakna in kipia a, tua munah biaknataute zong lozau sungah suang kholte suak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ih taanghpupi Jacob sia Mesopotamia ah tai a, zi khat a nga natu in tua munah midang khat ii na seamin a tuute cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Egypt a saltanna pan Israel mite a suatak tu le a keam tu in Topa in kamsaang khat puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mite in Topa nasia takin thin uuksak hi; amate khialna liante hangin a thi tu in kilawm hi. Ama min a daisak uh hu in Topa in amate daan pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun bosa sungah Ephraim namte a pau ciang, Israel nam dangte lau a; amate in Ephraim thupi et hi. Ahihang tua mite Baal bia in mawna vawt ahi uh ciang hi sia hu in amate thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing ngaisutna le mihing khut taw a suai ngunn milimte — thik milimte a biak tu in a vawtna taw amate maw thua seseam uh hi. Tuasia zawk ciang amate in, “Tuate tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia vun!” ci hi. Bangbangin akua in tua milimte — khuital lim a, a kivawtte — namh thei tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi mite in zingsang mokkaaite bangin mang tu a, nisua tuung a bo daaituite taw kibang hi. Amate sia taangcilna phual pan, vui ii seamkeak a site bang, meikhu suana pan meikhu bang hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Keima in Topa noma ii Pathian, Egypt pan hong pui pa khi hi. Kei simngawl Pathian dang nei ngawl nu hi. Keima bekma na ngumpa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Senneal lei kona ah note kong keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang tua ngam phana ah na tum uh ciang ankham in na lung uh kim a, tuasia ciang, kiphasakin, kei nong mangil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tawpi khat bangin no kong sim tu hi. Na lampi tungah pawlbeam khat bangin kong pang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A note a bosua vompui khat bangin note kong sim tu a, kong baltham tu hi. Tawpi khat bangin thakhatin kong ne tum paih tu a, ngamsa khat bangin kong balneen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, hong susia tu khi hi! Tuasia ciang akua in no hong hu thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in kumpi khat le lampuite ngen nu hi, ahihang amate in na ngam uh bangbang hu thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin uukna taw kumpite kong pia zo a, ka thinso in thangsiatna taw amate ka la keak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel ii mawna le khialna te kiciamtee a, a kitepteenate bit takin kikeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel in nuntak natu hunpha nei napi a mawmawt lei hu in tua nuntakna la thei ngawl hi — a suak dektak nausen khat naubu sung pan a pusuak nuam ngawl taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi mite sia mithi khua pan ka ngum buatu a, ahibuale thina vaang pan ka suatak buatu hi. Thina awng, na pul natnate hong paipui ta'n! Mithi khua awng, na suksiat theina hong paipui ta'n! Hi mite ka hesuak nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel in lopa bangin pung hikale, sennealngam pan nisuana vuisa khat ka vasak tu a, a tuinaakte le a tuikhukte ka kangsak tu hi. Tua vuisa in a mannei na theampo lenmang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei hong langpan hu in Samaria sia daan kipia nanak tu hi. A mite ngal sungah thi tu uh hi; nausente sia lei denna in kinei tu a, naupaai nupite ngil kikui tham tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite awng, Topa na Pathian kungah heak kik vun. Noma mawna in hong lutusak a, hong puksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa kungah heak kik vun a, hi thungetna sia ama tungah na biakpiakna uh hisak vun: “Koma mawna theampo hong maisak ta'n a, ka thungetna uh hong saang ta'n. Tuaciang kong kamciam bangin nang hong pok tu khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria in ko hong hung thei ngeingawl a, ngal siphute in ko hong dal thei ngawl hi. Kote in milimte tungah ka Pathian hi ci kik ngei nawn bua vak ung. Topa awng, nangma in belh tu dang a nei ngawlte hesuak ni hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka mite ka kung ka then kik tu hi. Ka thin theampo taw amate ka it tu a; amate tungah ka thin uuk nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in Israel mite tungah ngam kona ah nguatui bang ka hi tu hi. Amate in paakte bangin a palh tu hi; Lebanon thingkungte bangin a zung kho tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in khantona thak taw nungta tu a, olive kung hoi te bangin etlawm tu hi. Lebanon Cedar te bangin amate namtui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khatvei ma amate sia keima angvanna sungah nungta tu uh hi. Amate in an ciing in, sapithuan bangin ngathiam tu hi. Amate sia Lebanon sapittui bangin minthang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite sia milimte taw kisai nawn ngawl tu hi. Amate ii thungetnate ka zo tu a, amate ka keam tu hi; A tee a hing tawntung thingkung bangin amate ka uap tu a; a thupha theampo ii naak ka hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miciimte in hi sung a, a ki atte tel tahen a, a thinsung uh ah ciing thei tahen. Topa ii lampite maan a, thutang mite in tuate a zuina taw nungta uh hi, ahihang mimaw mikhial te lutu in puk uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in tua thute awlmaw ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
</usx>
